    "group": "Rad-Zone Corps",
    "summary": "BOMBARDMENT applies as battle round one opens. For each opposing unit within the opponent’s deployment zone, the opponent chooses whether it stands firm or takes cover. Roll a D6 per unit. Unit Standing Firm: That unit takes D3 mortal wounds if the result reaches 3+. Unit Taking Cover: The unit is battle-shocked. A 5+ also deals D3 mortal wounds. Under FALLOUT, roll a D6 for every opposing unit in that deployment zone as your Command phase opens in battle rounds two through five. A 3+ deals 1 mortal wound and obliges the damaged unit to attempt a Battle-shock test.",
